tras/43ccad0a263df8914688adcac00773cf.mp4?t=1750972134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Arcade Action Meets Modern Roguelite Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of <strong>tight 2D action</strong> inspired by classic arcade combat. Run-and-gun, dash, slash, and combo your way through fast, responsive encounters, then unlock permanent upgrades between runs in classic roguelite fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/e0fdd1c669f79f8aee1c35cc46fb4d76.poster.avif?t=1750972134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/e0fdd1c669f79f8aee1c35cc46fb4d76.webm?t=1750972134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2398140/extras/e0fdd1c669f79f8aee1c35cc46fb4d76.mp4?t=1750972134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural City Hunts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two missions are the same. Explore procedurally generated city zones, adapt to randomized enemy loadouts and layouts, and chase criminals across dynamic cyberpunk environments.</p>",
